  _subtitle: Dark woods and Kalidahs
  _description: Thick woods where the [[2068ec5f-e108-487b-a58a-19fa835fb595|Tin
    Woodman]] stood rusted for a year, and where the [[1f3bde9e-b7b4-4f25-84b5-bb07bc7708e2|Cowardly
    Lion]] jumps out at the travelers. Beyond the great ditches live the Kalidahs.
